in the below the sector median among Healthcare peers, improving at 16%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $43K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $9K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 9\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["Green Thumb Industries Inc. is a small-cap healthcare business with a $1.5B market cap on $1.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +5% over the past three years, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 5% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests. Gross margins of 51% confirm genuine pricing power.","The business throws off $214M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 18 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 2.58\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 6.9\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.8) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins softening -1.5pp YoY \u2014 early warning on the moat","sev":"amber","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $3.9M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-3937853.03},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 11% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 86% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 15% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.3% return)","Healthcare tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Green Thumb Industries Inc. (GTBIF) Reports Q3 Loss, Beats Revenue Estimates","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3023729/green-thumb-industries-inc-gtbif-reports-q3-loss-beats-revenue-estimates?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_4-3023729","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793835906.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.318,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Green Thumb Industries GAAP EPS of -$0.02 misses by $0.05, revenue of $324.2M beats by $16.36M (OTCMKTS:GTBIF)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4665572-green-thumb-industries-gaap-eps-of-0_02-misses-by-0_05-revenue-of-324_2m-beats-by-16_36m","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793826